MagicSearch *-- IndexManager
MagicSearch *-- BanProvider
MagicSearch *-- OsmProvider
MagicSearch *-- LayerProvider
MagicSearch *-- BanReverseProvider
MagicSearch *-- ReverseGeocodeTool
MagicSearch *-- StreetViewTool
MagicSearch *-- "0..1" MagicSearchWidget : ui_style = maps
MagicSearch *-- "0..1" MagicSearchDockWidget : ui_style = qt5
