MagicSearchDockWidget ..> ReverseGeocodeTool : reverse_toggled -> setMapTool
MagicSearchWidget ..> StreetViewTool : street_view_requested -> setMapTool
MagicSearchDockWidget ..> StreetViewTool : street_view_requested -> setMapTool

MagicSearchWidget --> IndexManager
MagicSearchWidget --> BanProvider
MagicSearchWidget --> OsmProvider
MagicSearchWidget --> LayerProvider
MagicSearchWidget *-- DropdownWidget
MagicSearchWidget *-- CollapsedButton
MagicSearchWidget *-- SearchIconWidget
MagicSearchWidget *-- StayOnTopEventFilter
MagicSearchWidget ..> geo_actions : zoom / surbrillance
DropdownWidget *-- "0..*" ResultItem
DropdownWidget *-- "0..*" ExpandItem

MagicSearchDockWidget --> IndexManager
MagicSearchDockWidget --> BanProvider
MagicSearchDockWidget --> OsmProvider
MagicSearchDockWidget --> LayerProvider
MagicSearchDockWidget *-- StayOnTopEventFilter
MagicSearchDockWidget *-- "0..*" ResultItemDock
MagicSearchDockWidget *-- "0..*" ExpandItemDock
